# 🌴🦍Jungle Man - Your Home is the Jungle 🦍🌴
"Jungle Man" invites you into an exhilarating mixed reality world where swinging through the jungle is the heart of the adventure. Swing Jungle Man across procedurally generated spatial puzzles including living jungles, dangerous swamps and lava caves. Each level presents new dangers, traps, and obstacles!
